---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="World Readiness Essay Submission"
  description="Ready for What? Submit a personal essay on your definition of world readiness by November 16, 2026. Selected students present at the World Readiness Conference on February 12, 2027 and receive a $250 stipend."
>
  <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
  <nav class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-light">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-primary">Home</a></li>
        <li class="text-gray-400">/</li>
        <li class="text-text-dark font-medium">World Readiness</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-footer-bg text-white overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-footer-bg via-footer-bg to-accent-orange/40"></div>
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-24 md:py-32 text-center">
      <p class="text-accent-orange font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">
        A Collaborative Conference for Student Success and World Readiness
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-6">Ready for What?</h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 mb-10">
        Hosted by the Center for Government &amp; Civic Service
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://forms.gle/gpM1X2QZDtwWWnXx6"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-semibold hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors"
      >
        Submit Your Essay
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Facts -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[120px] text-center">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-light uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Essay Deadline</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold text-text-dark">November 16, 2026</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-light">11:59 PM</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[120px] text-center">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-light uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Conference Date</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold text-text-dark">February 12, 2027</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-light">10:00 AM &ndash; 4:00 PM</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[120px] text-center">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-light uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Location</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold text-text-dark">CGCS, ACC RGC</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-light">Building 3000</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[120px] text-center">
          <p class="text-sm text-text-light uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">If Selected</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold text-text-dark">Present on a Panel</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-light">$250 stipend</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Writing Prompt -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="section-heading mb-10 text-center">Writing Prompt</h2>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-8 md:p-12">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Introduction</p>
        <p class="text-text-light leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The Boyer 2030 Commission Report (2022) defines <em>world readiness</em> as "...a vision
          of undergraduate education that includes and goes beyond the essential goal of near-term
          workforce readiness to empower students for citizenship, life, and work throughout their
          lifetimes...that broadens horizons, stimulates curiosity and involves discovery of fields
          of knowledge, ways of knowing, and perspectives well beyond what most students have
          encountered..." (pp. 11&ndash;12). But the ways in which students translate world
          readiness into their everyday lives is unique to them.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-3 mt-8">The Question</p>
        <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-dark mb-4">What is your definition of world readiness?</p>
        <p class="text-text-light italic leading-relaxed mb-6">
          We are collectively working to understand the concept of world readiness. There are no
          wrong answers to this question. You are empowered to define it for yourself.
        </p>

        <p class="text-text-dark font-medium mb-3">Here are some ideas on how to approach this question:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
          {[
            'What social, economic, political, and technological circumstances must we consider?',
            "What are you doing today – both through your formal education and in your everyday life – that's leading you to the person you want to be?",
            'What does living a good life mean to you?',
          ].map(item => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-light">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-teal flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <p class="text-text-dark font-semibold mb-3">Requirements</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-text-light">
            <li>Choose one or more of the questions above.</li>
            <li>Write an essay of <strong class="text-text-dark">at least 1,200 words</strong>.</li>
            <li>Provide examples from your life and references that support your argument(s).</li>
            <li>
              Include at least <strong class="text-text-dark">two footnotes</strong> &mdash; one
              referencing the Boyer 2030 Commission Report and one additional reference.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Submission requirements -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-8 md:p-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-dark mb-6">What to Submit</h2>

        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-10">
          {[
            'Your full name and student email address',
            'Your essay, uploaded as a Word or Docs document (1,200+ words, 2+ footnotes)',
          ].map(item => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-text-light">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-teal flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
              {item}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>

        <p class="text-text-light mb-2">
          Open to students across academic institutions. Essays are due
          <strong class="text-text-dark"> November 16, 2026 at 11:59 PM</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-light mb-10">
          Selected students present as part of a panel discussion at the conference on
          <strong class="text-text-dark"> February 12, 2027</strong> and receive a
          <strong class="text-text-dark"> $250 stipend</strong>.
        </p>

        <a
          href="https://forms.gle/gpM1X2QZDtwWWnXx6"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-base"
        >
          Submit Your Essay
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Questions -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-dark mb-4">Have Questions?</h2>
      <p class="text-text-light mb-8">
        We're happy to work directly with you on the research and writing process. Reach out to
        any of us:
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {[
          { name: 'Bryan Port', email: 'bryan.port@austincc.edu' },
          { name: 'Marisela Perez-Maita', email: 'marisela.perezmaita@austincc.edu' },
          { name: 'Christopher Rzigalinski', email: 'christopher.rzigalinski@austincc.edu' },
        ].map(contact => (
          <a
            href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}
            class="block bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-gray-200 hover:border-primary/40 hover:shadow-md transition-all"
          >
            <p class="font-bold text-text-dark">{contact.name}</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-primary mt-1 break-all">{contact.email}</p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
